<%# The mark of a figure an anomaly makes wrong (DESIGN.md §15.5): the warning
    triangle sits beside the metric's label, like the record trophy, and its
    tooltip carries the sentence so the summary keeps its size. The analysis
    tab holds both the sentence and the stretch as text. %>
<%= tag.span(class: "allure-anomaly-note", role: "img", tabindex: 0, aria: { label: note[:text] },
             data: tooltip_data(note[:text])) do %>
  <i class="ti ti-alert-triangle text-warning" aria-hidden="true"></i>
<% end %>
